    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>For YouTubers, Twitch Streamers and Content Creators</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455140/extras/d62aee08bb6efeec2c32fb633c56e950.avif?t=1668615703\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Dodge obstacles and build the 1,950+ mile-long border wall across the southern border of the <strong>USA</strong> while collecting <strong>Trumpbux</strong> to raise your score! \ud83d\udcb5<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Newest Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Power-Ups: Ghost Objects, Extra Life and Trumpbux  Multipliers...<br></li><li><strong>Hats!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\uddfd FEATURES \ud83e\udd85</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A Procedurally-Generated 2.5D Environment<br></li><li>The Donald<br></li><li>The Wall <br></li><li>Trumpbux to Collect<br></li><li>Achievements to Unlock<br></li><li>Checkpoint System <i>(Every 10% Progress)</i><br></li><li>Custom Wall Skins</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455140/extras/1af91956377cd61a17c0ac8b9a0382c1.poster.avif?t=1668615703\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455140/extras/1af91956377cd61a17c0ac8b9a0382c1.webm?t=1668615703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455140/extras/1af91956377cd61a17c0ac8b9a0382c1.mp4?t=1668615703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Dodge obstacles and build the 1,950+ mile-long border wall across the southern border of the <strong>USA</strong> while collecting <strong>Trumpbux</strong> to raise your score! \ud83d\udcb5<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Newest Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Power-Ups: Ghost Objects, Extra Life and Trumpbux  Multipliers...<br></li><li><strong>Hats!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83d\uddfd FEATURES \ud83e\udd85</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A Procedurally-Generated 2.5D Environment<br></li><li>The Donald<br></li><li>The Wall <br></li><li>Trumpbux to Collect<br></li><li>Achievements to Unlock<br></li><li>Checkpoint System <i>(Every 10% Progress)</i><br></li><li>Custom Wall Skins</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455140/extras/1af91956377cd61a17c0ac8b9a0382c1.poster.avif?t=1668615703\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455140/extras/1af91956377cd61a17c0ac8b9a0382c1.webm?t=1668615703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1455140/extras/1af91956377cd61a17c0ac8b9a0382c1.mp4?t=1668615703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
